type: software
title: OpenHeritage3D-VIS
abstract: >-
  A browser-based Potree viewer template for cultural heritage point clouds,
  extending base Potree with a classification brush tool, zone-based
  navigation, oriented-image panoramas, and point cloud download tooling.
